        <detaileddescription>
<para>Create an iOS controller using a running XDeviceBridge server. udid is required; transport and capture selections use their iOS enums. config_json: optional server_port (XDB_PORT or 17423), wifi_address, wifi_port (49152), shared_control (false). xdb owns phone credentials and DDI setup. Stream obtains decoded BGRA; ScreenshotService obtains lossless PNG. Touch coordinates use the last delivered image geometry; contacts 0..4 are supported. Text accepts US-layout ASCII, tab and newline; unsupported text is rejected. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
